te}}) to be added in the report.\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.12.43 (c4f67922-c49c-438b-8f67-5d01da00f88e).png|width=645,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.12.43.png\"!\n\n*AC2 :* (/) \nNew columns should be placed between existing {{User phone}}  and {{Price without VAT}} column\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.13.35.png|width=645,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.13.35.png\"!\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.12.43 (c4f67922-c49c-438b-8f67-5d01da00f88e).png|width=645,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.12.43.png\"!\n\n\n *AC3:*{{Local price}} (/) \n\n* For business rides, price will be derived from price and exchange rate of invoicing portal api\n* For cash rides, price will be same as “price with vat”\n\n*Estonian test company (rides done in UK with payment methods invoice, cash, card and one ride done in Estonia with invoice):*\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.13.35 (2b7b19ff-079b-4671-ab7d-c87a13b05b05).png|width=645,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.13.35.png\"!\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.12.43.png|width=645,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.12.43.png\"!\n\n\n\n*AC4:*{{Local currency}}\n\n* For business rides, local currency to be fetched from invoicing portal api.\n* For cash rides, the value will be same as “currency”\n\n*Estonian test company (rides done in UK with payment methods invoice, cash, card and one ride done in Estonia with invoice):*\n\n“Local currency” for rides in UK is in GBP but “Currency” is displyed for business payment method rides in EUR. Rides in UK usin cash/card are shown in GBP for both Local currency and Currency\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.13.35 (93966273-f891-4d63-b668-592b29ff2224).png|width=645,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.13.35.png\"!\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.12.43 (8f01e14f-a75b-4c24-9e11-af68d77e9751).png|width=645,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.12.43.png\"!\n\n*Ukranian test company (couple of rides done in Kiev and one in Estonia - Tallinn)*\n\nRide in Estonia for this Ukrainian company has “Local currency” in EUR since it’s a business payment method using ride and “Currency” will be UAH since it’s a Ukrainian company\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.20.00.png|width=645,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.20.00.png\"!\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.25.54.png|width=645,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.25.54.png\"!\n\n\n\n*AC5:*{{Exchange rate}}\n\n*Estonian test company (rides done in UK with payment methods invoice, cash, card and one ride done in Estonia with invoice):*\n\n* exchange rate is shown for Business(invoice) rides where local currency doesn’t match the company curreny (e.g. GBP local price and exchange rate is available since company country currency is EUR)\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.13.35 (2b7b19ff-079b-4671-ab7d-c87a13b05b05).png|width=645,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.13.35.png\"!\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.12.43 (e9299049-06cf-47e2-bb8e-111dfcb89378).png|width=645,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.12.43.png\"!\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.36.07.png|width=645,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.36.07.png\"!\n\n*Ukranian test company (couple of rides done in Kiev and one in Estonia - Tallinn)*\n\n* exchange rate is shown for Business(invoice) rides where local currency doesn’t match the company curreny - in this case since exchange rate is shown for the Estonian ride because company currency is UAH and the Tallinn ride local currency is EUR\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.20.00.png|width=645,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.20.00.png\"!\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.25.54.png|width=645,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.25.54.png\"!\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.28.57.png|width=645,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-22 at 15.28.57.png\"!","2026-01-22T13:37:22.478Z"],["3830857","L10N-29603","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place 