ng on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-29766](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-29766)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-23T07:22:46.012Z"],["3832201","HS-29280","HS","alice.gorobets@bolt.eu","Alice Gorobets","we don’t have the termination doc/article info yet","2026-01-23T07:24:01.031Z"],["3832202","HS-29281","HS","alice.gorobets@bolt.eu","Alice Gorobets","we don’t have the termination doc/article info yet","2026-01-23T07:24:05.060Z"],["3832203","PFI-837306","PFI","monika.civrag@bolt.eu","Monika Čivrag","The technical team says that the issue was resolved.","2026-01-23T07:24:27.737Z"],["3832204","LSS-61747","LSS","liivika.tamm@bolt.eu","Liivika Tamm","As confirmed via Slack, these claims are fake. Thus, I’ll be closing the ticket.\n\nThank you!","2026-01-23T07:24:33.606Z"],["3832205","EBIOT-243","EBIOT","aydin.zengin@bolt.eu","Aydın Zengin","Printed. ","2026-01-23T07:25:45.867Z"],["3832210","FRAUDOPS-1135","FRAUDOPS","nigar.alizada@bolt.eu","Nigar Alizada","{code:sql}SELECT DISTINCT\n  d.meta.business_company_id,\n  lower(trim(get_json_object(d.input, '$.data.business_admin_email'))) AS business_email\nFROM sel_fraud_checks_pii_spark.business_signup_check d\nWHERE lower(trim(get_json_object(d.input, '$.data.country'))) = 'gb'\n  AND lower(trim(get_json_object(d.input, '$.data.business_admin_email')))\n      RLIKE '^[a-z]{2,15}[0-9]{2,10}@gmail\\\\.com$';{code}","2026-01-23T07:27:56.024Z"],["3832211","FX-3696","FX","meruzhan.kerobyan@bolt.eu","Meruzhan Kerobyan","^#sync^ {quote}\n{color:red}*FleetX reports [wrote|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C02FP2YL06L/p1769153279630289]*{color}:\nThank you for the report, <@uns>!\n\nOur team duty champion will review [your request|https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/FX-3696] soon.\n{quote}","2026-01-23T07:28:11.555Z"],["3832213","FX-3696","FX","meruzhan.kerobyan@bolt.eu","Meruzhan Kerobyan","^#sync^ {quote}\n{color:red}*Pavel Halavan [wrote|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C02FP2YL06L/p1769153281128679]*{color}:\nNot used anywhere yet on live. Apply proper colors scheme from prelive to live config\n{quote}","2026-01-23T07:28:13.625Z"],["3832216","EBIOT-219","EBIOT","aydin.zengin@bolt.eu","Aydın Zengin","{adf:display=block}\n{\"type\":\"table\",\"attrs\":{\"isNumberColumnEnabled\":false,\"layout\":\"align-start\",\"localId\":\"4430818b-df04-49cc-af6d-89754768260a\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tableRow\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tableHeader\",\"attrs\":{\"colspan\":3,\"background\":\"#ffebe6\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"24h in 1m depth - FAILED\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"strong\"},{\"type\":\"textColor\",\"attrs\":{\"color\":\"#ff5630\"}}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Start: 20.01.2026 18:10\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"End: 21.01.2026 18:10\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"tableRow\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tableCell\",\"attrs\":{},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"mediaSingle\",\"attrs\":{\"width\":216,\"widthType\":\"pixel\",\"layout\":\"align-start\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"media\",\"attrs\":{\"type\":\"file\",\"id\":\"IMG_0053.JPEG\",\"alt\":\"IMG_0053.JPEG\",\"collection\":\"upload-user-collection--1136578425\",\"height\":3840,\"width\":2160}}]}]},{\"type\":\"tableCell\",\"attrs\":{},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"mediaSingle\",\"attrs\":{\"width\":216,\"widthType\":\"pixel\",\"layout\":\"align-start\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"media\",\"attrs\":{\"type\":\"file\",\"id\":\"IMG_0085.JPEG\",\"alt\":\"IMG_0085.JPEG\",\"collection\":\"upload-user-collection--1136578425\",\"height\":2048,\"width\":1536}}]}]},{\"type\":\"tableCell\",\"attrs\":{},\"