267790143,\n  \"sourceUserType\": \"user\",\n  \"targetCustomerId\": 267790143,\n  \"targetCustomerType\": \"user\",\n  \"userPresent\": false\n}{noformat}\n\ngroupSystemType is {{subscription_legacy}} while sourceType is {{rental}}. Need to investigate how it was mismatched","2026-01-23T12:11:12.308Z"],["3833514","WD-22660","WD","darja.netjaga@bolt.eu","Darja Netjaga","Got it. Should it be like this? Please have a look and let me know so I can proceed with changes.\n\n!image-20260123-120955.png|width=368,alt=\"image-20260123-120955.png\"!\n\n \n\nKind regards,\n\nDarja Netjaga","2026-01-23T12:11:39.351Z"],["3833515","DMP-587","DMP","vadim.pislari@bolt.eu","Vadim Pîslari","Completed in [https://github.com/bolteu/admin-panel/pull/17294|https://github.com/bolteu/admin-panel/pull/17294|smart-link]. ","2026-01-23T12:11:40.050Z"],["3833518","PFI-836761","PFI","fatima.omran@bolt.eu","Fatima Amin Omran","Hi Bot! Not what I asked. The amount they received differs from the invoice amount. Why?","2026-01-23T12:12:01.523Z"],["3833519","SCM-1027","SCM","zuzanna.antoniewska@bolt.eu","Zuzanna Izabela Antoniewska","Is it finished? [~accountid:627aae199311100068a00836] ","2026-01-23T12:12:05.566Z"],["3833520","MLC-3731","MLC","daria.trokhina@bolt.eu","Daria Trokhina","*Week 4:*\n\n* Banners are updated, but some info is still missing from the Growth team.","2026-01-23T12:12:13.719Z"],["3833521","CCM-22304","CCM","peace.anumia@bolt-outsource.eu","Peace Anumia","[^New Training Request form _ Teleperformance (23rd of January 26).xlsx]","2026-01-23T12:12:54.633Z"],["3833523","LSS-60103","LSS","samuel.dubnicky@bolt.eu","Samuel Dubnický","Hi, legal team. This is response from client: \n”Hello, Mr. Dubnický, please find attached a version of the NDA - bilateral, which should agree with your proposal. A change in Estonian legislation is not possible in this case, so we request that Slovakia be retained. Please review this with your legal department and let us know if this is acceptable and we can proceed with signing the NDA. “\n\n\n\nIs there any chance to find any middle ground to proceed with this NDA?\n\n[^Bilateral NDA SWEP to Supplier - SK.docx]\n\n","2026-01-23T12:13:30.611Z"],["3833524","WD-22660","WD","maryia.batalava@bolt.eu","Maryia Batalava","yes, exactly 🙂 ","2026-01-23T12:13:45.991Z"],["3833525","FPD-1552","FPD","ali.shojaee@bolt.eu","Ali Shojaee","I’ve opened the PR with forward-chaining CV and started the backtesting run. The results aren’t ready yet because we hit an MLflow rate limit. Here’s the error:\n\nDetailed errors:\n\n* rider_activation_pct: API request to [https://frankfurt.cloud.databricks.com/api/2.0/mlflow/artifacts/credentials-for-write|https://frankfurt.cloud.databricks.com/api/2.0/mlflow/artifacts/credentials-for-write] failed with exception HTTPSConnectionPool(host='[frankfurt.cloud.databricks.com|http://frankfurt.cloud.databricks.com]', port=443): Max retries exceeded with url: /api/2.0/mlflow/artifacts/credentials-for-write (Caused by ResponseError('too many 429 error responses'))\n\nI’ve removed MLflow saving for now and I’m re-running the backtesting. I will update the results here as soon as i am done\n\n\nHere’s the link to the backtest:\n\n{{🚀 Starting backtest execution for 12 folds... 📍 Target cities: Abuja, Accra, Algarve, Amsterdam, Arad, Asunción, Baku, Bangkok, Barcelona, Benin City, Berlin, Bialystok, Birmingham, Bordeaux, Brampton, Brasov, Bratislava, Bristol, Brno, Brussels, Bucharest, Buzau, Bydgoszcz, Cape Town, Chernivtsi, Chiang Mai, Ciudad del Este, Cluj-Napoca, Coimbra, Cologne, Constanta, Copenhagen, Craiova, Dar es Salaam, Dnipro, Dublin, Durban, Dusseldorf, East London, Emalahleni, Frankfurt, Galati, Gothenburg, Helsinki, Iasi, Johannesburg, Kalisz, Kaunas, Klaipeda, Kosice, Koszalin, Krakow, Kumasi, Kyiv, Lagos, Lille, Limassol, Lisbon, Lodz, London, Lublin, Lviv, Lyon, Madeira, Madrid, Malaga, Malmö, Manchester, Marseille, Milton Keynes, Mississauga, Munich, Nairobi, Nice, Nuremberg, Odesa, 