 questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-29800](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-29800)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-23T12:31:27.254Z"],["3833652","L10N-29871","L10N",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Hi ,\n\nThanks for picking up this task!  \nPlease note that **all comments, questions, and discussions should be added under the parent Epic** (the main ticket above this one).\n\n💬 Keeping the conversation in one place ensures that:\n- All linguists working on the project are aligned\n- The content owner can answer all queries at once\n- We avoid fragmented or duplicate discussions\n\n📌 While we aim to keep individual language tasks updated, the **Epic acts as the main source of truth**. It’s where you’ll find the latest context, updates, and team-wide communication.\n\n🔗 You can find the parent Epic here: [L10N-29837](https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/L10N-29837)\n\nThanks for collaborating!","2026-01-23T12:31:29.813Z"],["3833653","RDS-1190","RDS","dashiell.stanford@bolt.eu","Dash Stanford","[~accountid:712020:6b7effe8-70c7-4436-a9a0-e4b027cf915f] We have a recalculation communication at the end of the ride:\n\n!image-20260123-122907.png|width=637,height=154,alt=\"image-20260123-122907.png\"!\n\n!image-20260123-123116.png|width=616,height=156,alt=\"image-20260123-123116.png\"!\n\nThe problem is that riders don’t expect this. And when the price increases, it is a highly unwelcome surprise (hence the enormous CS volume/cost).\n\nWe know internally that the price shown on the category list is just an estimate and can always change. But riders don’t see it this way. Many assume it’s final. \n\nSo the idea is just to build a bit of trust before introducing upward recalculation. ","2026-01-23T12:31:31.798Z"],["3833655","HS-29325","HS","promise.tshabalala@bolt.eu","Promise Nomaswazi Tshabalala","I’ve also tried signing manually using my work email,but still get the same error.","2026-01-23T12:31:41.599Z"],["3833658","INT-85","INT","zhenyu.wang@bolt.eu","Zhenyu Wang","26W4 Launched experiment for churned uplift model. Experiment will finish in 4 weeks.","2026-01-23T12:32:04.371Z"],["3833662","LSS-61807","LSS","dawit.villarzu@bolt.eu","Dawit Villarzu","@legal Ops, could you please collect signatures from Ahto Kink for these Documents? Thank you!","2026-01-23T12:32:58.229Z"],["3833664","LSS-60946","LSS","kostiantyn.ponomarov@bolt.eu","Kostiantyn Ponomarov","The user did not respond - closing the ticket.","2026-01-23T12:33:52.679Z"],["3833670","CEBF-1703","CEBF","pradeep.yadav@bolt.eu","Pradeep Kumar Yadav","[~accountid:712020:c573470a-712d-474e-a9e6-b0635a9decb9] \n\n{quote}Should the account plan be activated when it is sent for approval?\n\n– Yes\n\nto do read-only on UI, I have to change the standard layout on dynamic forms. Right?\n-- Yes{quote}","2026-01-23T12:36:07.337Z"],["3833672","PFI-834137","PFI","artem.lishchuk@bolt.eu","Artem Lishchuk","Nice, thanks, all invoices now seem to be processed correctly.","2026-01-23T12:37:05.997Z"],["3833674","LSS-61929","LSS","aleksandra.tretiak@bolt.eu","Aleksandra Tretiak","Hey, [~accountid:712020:66939b2f-e5c1-42e2-8cbe-244458fd12f9] ! Everything is clear.\n\nProper signatures will be prepared shortly.","2026-01-23T12:37:51.086Z"],["3833675","LSS-61350","LSS","kostiantyn.ponomarov@bolt.eu","Kostiantyn Ponomarov","Duplication - this is already being reviewed here - [https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/47/LSS-60146|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/47/LSS-60146|smart-link] ","2026-01-23T12:37:51.089Z"],["3833678","LSS-61350","LSS","kostiantyn.ponomarov@bolt.eu","Kostiantyn Ponomarov","CC [~accountid:6151cf6878e5e40070fb74c2] ⤵️  - added you to the ticket","2026-01-23T12:38:21.152Z"],["3833683","PFI-820918","PFI","tanel.molok@bolt.eu","Tanel Molok","Hi João,\n\nI see from the payout info that you tried to make the payout not to the tax authorities but to the fleet itself. \n\nBENEFICIARY’S NAME should be  *Service public fédéral Finances*\n\nIBAN and Swift are found on the letter.\n\nCould you please try with the correct recipient and let us know how it went.","2026-01-23T12:39:11.948Z"],["3833697","LSS-58811","LSS","wiktoria.znaczko@bolt.eu","Wiktoria Znaczko","Hello [~accountid:712020:b971e044-987e-4f04-8fbe-2c3b651e5a0f] Today we received a letter from the law firm in response to the document we recently prepared in this ticket. How can we respond to the law firm's arguments? \n\n[^Kancelaria Radcy Prawnego Bydgoszcz.pdf]\n\n\n\n","2026-01-23T12:41:18.684Z"],["3833698","LSS-60630","LSS","oluwatosin.ogunsanwo@bolt.eu","Oluwatosin Ogunsanwo","Hello [~accountid:712020:b2a2738f-c1f1-447c-9b72-29851b5fed3e] \n\nThank you for your help so far.\n\nI’ve started entering the information into the assessment platform and noticed that *six of the questions you responded to require selecting from a dropdown menu rather than free-text input*. I’ve highlighted the affected questions in red, and you can find the corresponding dropdown options in the tab titled *“Assessment Response Options.”*\n\nI know this is a bit impromptu, but I’d really appreciate it if you could review and let me know which options to select *before close of business today*, so I can complete the form and share it with the client as promised.\n\nThank you very much for your support!","2026-01-23T12:41:31.134Z"],["3833699","BD-2000","BD","ave.tarend@bolt.eu","Ave Tarend","PR: [https://github.com/bolteu/bolt-server/pull/161734|https://github.com/bolteu/bolt-server/pull/161734|smart-link] \n\n* added to agent type to query\n* added logging if refund reasons are not found","2026-01-23T12:41:34.664Z"],["3833700","WFM-10109","WFM","richard.salvador@bolt.eu","Richard Salvador","If it’s 5 cases as below, it’s done for all notifications. Otherwise, let me know if further adjustments are needed.","2026-01-23T12:41:39.709Z"],["3833701","WFM-10109","WFM","nikita.bogomazovs@bolt-outsource.eu","Nikita Bogomazovs","Pardon, typo. \n\nPQ_DE_Latvia - Open cases > 100 cases (Danger)\nPQ_DE_Lithuania - Open cases > 100 cases (Danger)\nPQ_DE_Estonia - Open cases > 100 cases (Danger)\n\nThank you and happy Friday! 🙂 ","2026-01-23T12:41:42.664Z"],["3833702","PFI-837230","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","👋 Thank you for submitting this ticket!\n\nLooks like you've selected invalid Request Type which isn't handled by this team. Create a new ticket for the correct team! \n\n- [Partner Payments] Business made payment, but didn't reflect: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/59/create/306\n- [Customer Payments] Business had issues with their credit card: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/59/create/303\n\n- Fraud related issues: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/59/create/304\n\n[Billing] - Business invoicing and balance issues: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/59/create/305\n\n[Billing/Tax Tech]- Business invoice has not been reported (Fiscalized) : https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/61/create/5247\n- Commission Changes, invoice issuer changes, feature requests, general configurations: https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/3/group/61/create/301\n\n\nCheers\nCommerce Team Jira Bot","2026-01-23T12:41:52.231Z"],["3833704","DBRE-8696","DBRE","juri.hudolejev@bolt.eu","Juri Hudolejev","General list of all changes (less details): [https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1COpIzFehlnqNenxOo8F_MCBsnUcD3TEKR5ka2F0zK4c/edit?gid=1250636136#gid=1250636136|https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1COpIzFehlnqNenxOo8F_MCBsnUcD3TEKR5ka2F0zK4c/edit?gid=1250636136#gid=1250636136|smart-link] .\n\nDetails for specific change are provided upon request (needs more work; [https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C05GP2V4X54/p1768910524831559?thread_ts=1768307447.610039&cid=C05GP2V4X54|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C05GP2V4X54/p1768910524831559?thread_ts=1768307447.610039&cid=C05GP2V4X54|smart-link]).\n\nUPD.\n\nDetailed info requested about 15 changes: [https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C05GP2V4X54/p1769510091134619?thread_ts=1768307447.610039&cid=C05GP2V4X54|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C05GP2V4X54/p1769510091134619?thread_ts=1768307447.610039&cid=C05GP2V4X54|smart-link]; updated the spreadsheet.","2026-01-23T12:42:44.955Z"],["3833705","WEBSD-1500","WEBSD","jevgeni.komkin@bolt.eu","Jevgeni Komkin","[https://bolt.onelink.me/sbJ2/udifrxte|https://bolt.onelink.me/sbJ2/udifrxte] \n\n\n[^qrcode-20260123-124221.svg]\n\n\n","2026-01-23T12:43:10.163Z"],["3833706","LSS-61436","LSS","sorina.mihai@bolt.eu","Sorina Mihai","Hey [~accountid:712020:52cfdad6-7e7c-4e24-b869-dd2ab87c9432] , do we have any update here please please? I was called by Omega on Monday and it’s already Friday… thank you!\n\nSorina ","2026-01-23T12:43:12.733Z"],["3833707","DO-5828","DO","mangesh.khairnar@bolt.eu","Mangesh Khairnar","[~accountid:5a91321e646c8a4475ece436] we follow the naming convention of looker-{domain_name}. Would {{looker-people}} work for you?","2026-01-23T12:43:19.532Z"],["3833708","PFI-837541","PFI","artem.lishchuk@bolt.eu","Artem Lishchuk","reissued","2026-01-23T12:43:24.473Z"],["3833710","HS-29325","HS",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey Promise,\n\nThanks for your request! We’ve moved your request to the correct People Services Support Desk so it can be handled by the right team.\n\nYou can view and track your request(s) here:\n [https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/32/PRL-8493|https://taxify.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/32/PRL-8493|smart-link]\n\nBest regards,\nPeople Services Team","2026-01-23T12:43:43.714Z"],["3833713","LSS-62035","LSS","dipanjali.saikia@bolt.eu","Dipanjali Saikia","[https://app.spotdraft.com/contracts/v2/346247|https://app.spotdraft.com/contracts/v2/346247|smart-link] ","2026-01-23T12:44:12.984Z"],["3833714","WFM-10108","WFM","richard.salvador@bolt.eu","Richard Salvador","BU roles already added","2026-01-23T12:44:19.776Z"],["3833716","BA-3031","BA","anastasiya.ivanova@bolt.eu","Anastasiya Ivanova","this is test example to use [https://github.com/bolteu/dbt/blob/main/commerce_billing/tests/balance/driver/fact_billing_rides_driver_earnings_integrity_test.sql|https://github.com/bolteu/dbt/blob/main/commerce_billing/tests/balance/driver/fact_billing_rides_driver_earnings_integrity_test.sql|smart-link] ","2026-01-23T12:44:28.465Z"],["3833718","LSS-62035","LSS","dipanjali.saikia@bolt.eu","Dipanjali Saikia","Hi [~accountid:712020:0dcccdab-40ef-4e81-988a-67af3ae07691], sent out for Ahto’s signature.","2026-01-23T12:45:01.970Z"],["3833719","WFM-10110","WFM","richard.salvador@bolt.eu","Richard Salvador","done [~accountid:642a97a99f314a0a30143c18]","2026-01-23T12:45:06.574Z"],["3833720","MLC-3880","MLC","sergio.ramirez@bolt.eu","Sergio Ramírez","*W4:* We Delivery Calendar training. “Treat Yourself & Valentine’s” ticket received; working on template setups, with modals planned for next week (Anette’s support) ","2026-01-23T12:45:07.614Z"],["3833721","LSS-61831","LSS","paula.pihelgas@bolt.eu","Paula Joanna Pihelgas","Please try to push them to Spotdraft is possible, makes everything much easier. \n\nIf that’s not an option, make sure to follow the instructions: \n\n_Contracts signed outside of SpotDraft/Legal Service Desk_ *_- once signed, all contracts_* _must be sent to_ [+*_contracts@bolt.eu_*+|mailto:contracts@bolt.eu]*_._* \n\n[^Customer Special Terms - Bolt Business (41)_sig (1).pdf] \n\n","2026-01-23T12:45:11.000Z"],["3833723","WFM-10106","WFM","kyrylo.yefimov@bolt.eu","Kyrylo Yefimov","Hey,[~accountid:5b9c83531b4803467d270c6e], We can offer temporary permissions to Specialists while TLs are on vacation. Wrapping up what you talked with Ruxandra please share on SD if there was any regional agreement for Specialists to help TLs with reports.","2026-01-23T12:45:44.748Z"],["3833724","PFI-837762","PFI",null,"Automation for Jira","Hey 👋\nThanks for opening a ticket to Billing. Our specialists will take a look at this ASAP.\nFor a faster response, please check our self-help FAQs. Most likely, your question is already answered there.\n\nRide-Hailing ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=564964225\n\nWork Profile ➡️ https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1P6YLwjKO7fS9OusUGnMX36NCvJUo3fQU8kSqRsbAt74/edit#gid=1631784415","2026-01-23T12:45:45.192Z"],["3833725","WFM-10065","WFM","richard.salvador@bolt.eu","Richard Salvador","queue assigned","2026-01-23T12:46:11.114Z"],["3833726","LSS-61436","LSS","aleksandra.tretiak@bolt.eu","Aleksandra Tretiak","Hey, [~accountid:60f2a71843c956007065f2ad] ! \n\nIt was signed from our side on 21/01 and currently the contract is pending with the Counterparty’s signature.\n\nThank you!\n\n!Screenshot 2026-01-23 at 14.45.50.png|width=683,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-23 at 14.45.50.png\"!","2026-01-23T12:46:40.554Z"],["3833729","WFM-10111","WFM","richard.salvador@bolt.eu","Richard Salvador","[~accountid:712020:75800db6-96e2-4bd3-b62e-19ba67cdd498] just check if user profiles in Admin don’t have child queues. If there are, clear it. On Assembled, add the Parent queues separately in each profile (not the child queues)","2026-01-23T12:47:14.554Z"],["3833730","C2-464","C2","hendrik.vorno@bolt.eu","Hendrik Võrno","Inverters for the test are ordered, ETA {{2026-01-26}} ","2026-01-23T12:47:32.056Z"],["3833731","PFI-837764","PFI","anastasiia.vynohradova@bolt.eu","Anastasiia Vynohradova","[^6_2_Сторони_несуть_повну_майнову_відповідальність_за_нанесені_іншій (1).pdf]\n\n[^ЩОДО ВИКОНАННЯ ДОРУЧЕННЯ (24).pdf]","2026-01-23T12:47:36.713Z"],["3833732","WD-22630","WD","magnus.vainumae@bolt.eu","Magnus Vainumäe","Hi [~accountid:63be776494d18cbf6772b360] if we add DNU to the cost center naming, it would trigger validation rule and no postings can be done. Could you please clear the cost centers so that we can proceed with request?","2026-01-23T12:48:02.854Z"],["3833733","WEB-9555","WEB","amal.bahar@bolt.eu","Amal Bahar","Hola [~accountid:712020:c7bffa72-768e-4809-ac1d-628c7bb93ccd]! Updated the description with final value props 🙂  ","2026-01-23T12:48:15.196Z"],["3833734","WFM-10098","WFM","richard.salvador@bolt.eu","Richard Salvador","Slovakia market access already added","2026-01-23T12:48:17.111Z"],["3833735","WD-22520","WD","alexandru.cerveanu@bolt.eu","Alex Cerveanu","Hi Andrea,\n\nCan you please check now?","2026-01-23T12:48:30.958Z"],["3833736","LSS-61827","LSS","alex.bucse@bolt.eu","Alex Bucșe","[~accountid:712020:548c71a6-d1f4-404d-9c5e-482bc0de371a] done, [~accountid:712020:4afbd60d-276d-4d8c-8d4c-5669fd772468] will get back to you and take it from there","2026-01-23T12:48:40.618Z"],["3833737","WFM-10102","WFM","richard.salvador@bolt.eu","Richard Salvador","duplicate ticket. Instructions provided in the new ticket created.","2026-01-23T12:48:52.544Z"],["3833738","PFI-837608","PFI","artem.lishchuk@bolt.eu","Artem Lishchuk","Hello, fixed it now\n\nFor future, you can also “Retry“ the invoice from the Invoices tab, when the issue is with Identity and was fixed: [https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/billing-fiscalization/fiscalization/invoices/860912811|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/billing-fiscalization/fiscalization/invoices/860912811]","2026-01-23T12:48:58.674Z"],["3833741","MM-972","MM",null,"Automation for Jira","||Readiness Criteria||Rating||Rationale||\n|Completeness|🟡|The issue describes the problem and a proposed solution, but lacks detailed requirements, edge cases, and acceptance criteria.|\n|Clarity|🟢|The language is clear and the problem/solution are understandable.|\n|Auditability|🟡|There is a Slack message linked, but no additional documentation or specs are referenced.|\n|Estimated|🔴|No time estimate is provided.|\n\nSuggestions:\n\n* Add acceptance criteria and edge cases to the description.\n* Provide a time estimate.\n* Link to any relevant documentation or specs if available.","2026-01-23T12:49:12.321Z"],["3833744","DPX-3543","DPX","giacomo.giorgianni@bolt.eu","Giacomo Giorgianni","Could you share more around what the information merchant need? \nThe discussion developed from wether we need to show the full list of item or we could only focus on showing, for example, only the top and bottom 10 performing articles.\nSo the question is: Which kind of actions do you we expect, this information will trigger in our merchants? \nAfter this is crelar, I’d like to discuss if we need to proceed with a simpler solution 🤔","2026-01-23T12:49:42.133Z"],["3833747","PFI-837631","PFI","artem.lishchuk@bolt.eu","Artem Lishchuk","This is due to the Resale VAT. When the Business company is under the Resale Billing Mode, the Ride invoice itself is issue to the Bolt Entity, which is being resold monthly to the company. Reseller has to charge VAT on top.","2026-01-23T12:50:23.656Z"],["3833748","LSS-54833","LSS","roisin.kirk@bolt.eu","Roisin Kirk","OK thank you.  Should I resolve our comments before I share back to the partner?  [~accountid:6151cf6878e5e40070fb74c2] ","2026-01-23T12:50:49.684Z"],["3833750","DSR-4009","DSR",null,"Automation for Jira","We've received your request. Our team is working on two-week sprints. Your request would be evaluated based on legal deadlines and complexity and included in the relevant sprint.\n\nOnce we assess the sprint dates for your request (not later than 2 weeks from the request), the assignee would notify you in this ticket.\n\nPlease check 🌍 [User: Data requests|https://beehive.bolt.eu/customer_support/kb/articles/internal/58951] to see if your request needs to be escalated to the Privacy Legal Team. If not, let us know in the ticket to cancel the request.\n\nFor urgent requests (legal deadline for responding to the user is shorter than 2 weeks), please tag Tatsiana Sivukha in this ticket.","2026-01-23T12:51:06.116Z"],["3833751","PFI-837766","PFI","chotiwit.takham@bolt-outsource.eu","Chotiwit Takham","!IMG_20260123_183934.jpg|thumbnail!\n\n!JPEG_1769169573120_7749677746029628054.jpg|thumbnail!","2026-01-23T12:51:18.997Z"],["3833753","PTWS-2135","PTWS","octavian.todor@bolt.eu","Octavian Todor","!Screenshot 2026-01-23 at 14.50.57.png|width=509,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-23 at 14.50.57.png\"!\n\nmoved to production, pinged Bruna and she confirmed it’s working as intended. Thank you [~accountid:611537e7eb7aef00696b29c1] [~accountid:712020:6850b463-f3bb-4458-b00b-b094810b5bcd] [~accountid:623ace37b75ca80070562c04]!","2026-01-23T12:51:34.997Z"],["3833754","MLC-4070","MLC","daria.trokhina@bolt.eu","Daria Trokhina","*Week 4:*\n\n* Had a kick off meeting with Anette, starting working on Hard Churn canvases.\n* Scheduled a call with Sergio for next Mon to review how the personalisation based on the catalogs can be implemented.","2026-01-23T12:52:01.945Z"],["3833757","MICRO-293","MICRO","ping.li@bolt.eu","Ping Sheng Li","Will implement from the user side when ever a score is adjusted, the reason is strikethrough and the negative score is icon is replaced with the grey tick icon.\nIf user has multiple penality on the same order, its is possible for one of the reasons to be strikethrough while the other still remains as well as the impact from the non-strikethrough offense to remain\n\n!image-20260123-125222.png|width=1448,height=849,alt=\"image-20260123-125222.png\"!","2026-01-23T12:52:26.062Z"],["3833758","PFI-834137","PFI","clara.machado@bolt.eu","Clara Oliveira Machado","Thanks [~accountid:712020:5c8bc485-83b5-47c2-ba7a-e8927f399b6f]. Is it possible to clarify that ones processed before? Thanks\n\n","2026-01-23T12:52:40.876Z"],["3833759","PTWS-2134","PTWS","octavian.todor@bolt.eu","Octavian Todor","I haven’t had time for this at all, sorry. I’ll start work on it next week.","2026-01-23T12:52:56.756Z"],["3833762","WFM-10106","WFM","eva.guantai@bolt.eu","Eva Guantai","Thanks again, Kyrylo. That’s understood. Please proceed to grant this. This is related to an upcoming contingency. \n\nThere’s no specific requirement for the other specialists in the region; this is specific to Kenya. I can reach out to Ruxandra to clarify because I’m not sure if I’m privy to the context referenced here (I haven’t had any recent conversations with). ","2026-01-23T12:53:10.531Z"],["3833763","WFM-10109","WFM","nikita.bogomazovs@bolt-outsource.eu","Nikita Bogomazovs","Hey [~accountid:712020:647d9435-b4ad-4729-aebd-e4f4f0044a62] \nSo yeah, not 5 cases, but 100 cases for delivery queue.\nAlso, I think you’ve made those Notificat